{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmhLtQMkxkRonbJNDP85","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm not doing anything yet. I'll ask you first, or the bank. The page couldn't tell me which fund to buy for my \"test\", so I don't know what the whole thing really costs. I'm fairly sure of that much.\n\n**What I decided**\n- At the top of the page, under the \"test\" button, it said \"האתר לא אסף קרנות על test\". After that, \"הוסיפו את הקרן שאתם שוקלים\". So I have to bring a fund myself, and I don't know one. The box on the fund side stayed empty: \"עוד לא נבחרה קרן\" and \"אין עדיין קרנות ברשימה\".\n- The page still ranked the companies for the account itself. Number 1 was פסגות with \"1,058 ₪\" and a little \"★ הזול\". That's the number I'll remember. But I don't think it includes the fund's own fee. It says the order changes once you add a fund, so I won't trust it for the whole cost.\n- My own bank, לאומי, was 4th with 4,547 ₪. So maybe the bank is taking more than it needs to. I'd still ask the clerk before I believed it.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. The heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד, לאורך זמן\". It talks about index investing, not deposits, so it's not my usual world. I stayed only because I came to see my \"test\".\n2. The four boxes. 10,000 ₪ today, 500 ₪ a month, 10 years, 7%. I didn't touch the sliders.\n3. The list of companies with ₪ amounts. פסגות 1,058, אינטראקטיב ישראל 1,303, Interactive Brokers 2,759, then לאומי 4,547 and on down to אקסלנס 26,861 ₪.\n4. The section \"מה כתוב בפרסום, מול התעריפון\", which I only half read. It said that for 6 companies the advertisement doesn't match the official price list. One example was פסגות's \"פטור מלא מדמי ניהול\". That worried me, because פסגות is the cheapest one.\n5. The grey lines at the bottom, which I skimmed: \"האתר לא ממליץ על מדד\", \"תשואה לדוגמה, לא תחזית\".\n\n**What I skipped**\n- The coloured bars on each line. I can't tell the orange from the yellow.\n- The little arrows that open more under each company.\n- \"לחיפוש במאיה\" and \"בקשו שנאסוף\".\n- \"+ הוספת חשבון בתנאים שקיבלתם\".\n- \"חוקים וכללים\" and the footer links.\n\n**What I didn't understand**\n- \"קרן מחקה\"\n- \"בחו\"ל\"\n- \"S&P 500\", \"MSCI World\", \"ת\"א-125\". I read them out letter by letter.\n- \"דמי משמרת\" and \"המרת מטבע\"\n- \"ריאלי\", and also \"זר\" next to my \"test\"\n- \"מחיר אחר ... לא בחישוב\"\n- What \"1,058 ₪\" actually means. Is it the total for all ten years?\n\n**What was hard to read**\n- The light grey writing on the black background, which was very small. That included the list of what's not counted and the colour legend.\n\n**Where I got worried**\n- Some of the lines have red bars, and the amounts get very big lower down. That scared me.\n- Between the first and second screen, part of the top of the companies list was cut off, so I'm not sure I saw everything. A couple of companies, numbers 6 and 13, I only saw a piece of.\n- By the fifth screen I was tired. Also, it's a site I've never heard of, called \"מקור\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5585,"cache_read_input_tokens":9646,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5585},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c767b448-d8c5-4a67-aca3-058e1fb79f9a","uuid":"2a1eaf8d-3351-4ddb-b1bf-b4deb4e6e899","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:45:19.337Z","request_id":"req_011CgmhLtBxFRQxS2p3HVHpq"}
